  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: End
    nextNodeID: 
    text: I'll come back again soon.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Reconsider
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: Bion is a young boy in a dire situation. Is it right for me to report him?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices0
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: It's for my sake. I don't have a choice.
      nextNodeID: TheBoy
      outcome:
        completionEvents:
        - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f202b0875ee0664c9f0ce15032d5eab, type: 2}
        - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a86fe1d68845e244e889dc9744b8a5c2, type: 2}
        - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d06c52e233db2141b8e5cf195d6c6ea, type: 2}
    - text: He didn't have a choice. I should cover his doing.
      nextNodeID: ForBion
      outcome:
        completionEvents:
        - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3930373a750c1c4f9699ff06b67e99e, type: 2}
        - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85b8d64a5cfa52d429a9cf75e2c85d05, type: 2}
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: ForBion
    nextNodeID: 
    text: I couldn't figure out the culprit. I'm a delivery man after all. I'll take
      full responsibility for the stolen goods.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: TheBaker
    nextNodeID: 
    text: Artopoios is the one who stole your wheat.
